# Normalise line endings.
#
# Two people on two machines will otherwise commit the same file with
# different endings, and every line of it shows as changed in the diff --
# which buries real changes and causes merge conflicts in files neither
# person meaningfully edited.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in the repository. Git still checks them
# out with whatever each developer's platform prefers, so nothing about
# working on Windows changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
